**Condition added to ruling B** · 2026-11-25T03:14Z · the maintainer's words, in seat repo:objectstack#4's session: 「docs 新外壳先画设计图给我看」.

The item-2 card runs in two stages.
1. **Design first.** Mockups of the app-less shell go to the maintainer, built from the real AppShell and sidebar components on a scratch branch, or as a static page. They cover:
   - desktop `/docs` landing;
   - one doc open;
   - the 「文档」 header with the app switcher open;
   - the collapsed sidebar;
   - phone, which stays unchanged.

   Each view gets a one-line note on what differs from the app shell.
2. **Build after approval.** No implementation PR until the maintainer approves the design on the card. An approval with changes is recorded on the card before the build starts.
